.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-release-backfill 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-release\-backfill \- Dispatch a backfill workflow once per release tag, oldest first, waiting on each run and stopping at the first that does not succeed
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten release backfill\fR [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-poll\-interval\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-polls\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-workflow\fR> <\fB\-\-ref\fR> <\fB\-\-pattern\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Dispatch a backfill workflow once per release tag, oldest first, waiting on each run and stopping at the first that does not succeed
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<tag>\fR
A release tag to record (repeatable); absent, every tag the pattern selects, oldest first
.TP
\fB\-\-workflow\fR \fI<workflow>\fR
The workflow file dispatched once per tag
.TP
\fB\-\-ref\fR \fI<ref>\fR
The branch the dispatched runs execute on
.TP
\fB\-\-pattern\fR \fI<pattern>\fR
The glob a release tag matches, as `git tag \-\-list` matches it
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print the plan, oldest first, and dispatch nothing
.TP
\fB\-\-poll\-interval\fR \fI<poll_interval>\fR
Seconds between polls; the forge\*(Aqs own interval raises it (default: 5)
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-polls\fR \fI<max_polls>\fR
Polls per tag before its run reads as never finishing (default: 240)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
